    <value>使用這台電腦上安裝的 Antigravity CLI 及其登入的 Google 帳號；請求會計入該帳號的限制。請在「終端機」中執行一次 `agy` 以登入；`agy models` 會列出模型 ID。推理強度：low、medium、high 或 max，僅適用於本身未帶等級的模型 ID（以 -high、-medium 或 -low 結尾的模型會忽略此設定）。執行時使用 agy 的 hearsay-notes 專案，其拒絕規則讓模型除了網路搜尋外無法使用任何工具，且每次執行的對話之後都會從 agy 的歷史記錄中刪除。</value>
    <comment>windows: Uses the Antigravity CLI installed on this PC and the Google account it is logged in with; requests count against that account's limits. Run `agy` once in Terminal to log in; `agy models` lists the model ids. Effort: low, medium, high, or max, only for a model id without its own level (a model ending in -high, -medium, or -low ignores it). Runs use agy's hearsay-notes project, whose deny rules leave the model no tools except web search, and each run's conversation is deleted from agy's history afterwards.</comment>
